      "representation": "storage",
      "value": "<h1>Onboarding guide</h1><p>Welcome to <strong>Acme</strong>. Read the <a href=\"https://acme.example/handbook\">handbook</a> first.</p><h2>First week</h2><ul><li>Get your laptop</li><li>Meet your buddy<ul><li>Daily check-in</li></ul></li></ul><ol><li>Sign the contract</li><li>Set up VPN</li></ol><table><tbody><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Owner</th></tr><tr><td>VPN</td><td>IT</td></tr><tr><td>Payroll</td><td>HR</td></tr></tbody></table><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[vpn connect --profile acme]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>Questions? Ask <code>#help-it</code>.</p>"
    }
